FR","overview":"Nicolas mène une existence paisible. Il a des parents qui l'aiment, une bande de chouettes copains avec lesquels il s'amuse bien, et il n'a pas du tout envie que cela change… Mais un jour, Nicolas surprend une conversation entre ses parents qui lui laisse penser que sa mère est enceinte. Il panique alors et imagine le pire : bientôt un petit frère sera là, qui prendra tellement de place que ses parents ne s'occuperont plus de lui, et qu'ils finiront même par l'abandonner dans la forêt comme le Petit Poucet…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bSwIsOGPxSpzJyHMB3SOmqiXfZw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cKPGIs0T8FMHMukaOEanP9Yxgbg.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":31203,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bSwIsOGPxSpzJyHMB3SOmqiXfZw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bSwIsOGPxSpzJyHMB3SOmqiXfZw.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bSwIsOGPxSpzJyHMB3SOmqiXfZw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bSwIsOGPxSpzJyHMB3SOmqiXfZw.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zOsPAIRyknuPhYpFV0nTzbVLlgM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zOsPAIRyknuPhYpFV0nTzbVLlgM.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zOsPAIRyknuPhYpFV0nTzbVLlgM.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zOsPAIRyknuPhYpFV0nTzbVLlgM.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pgigiq7lP8K3tHGRSpbBeAGMo95.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.or